      "Exact mirror of case_c_left_overhang about the wall midline (x' = 408 - x). Every member force must match the",
      "left-overhang fixture to machine precision (sign errors cannot hide in symmetry — PLAN §11.3).",
      "Case C member ids are numbered from the overhang-side support (frame-relative); absolute L/R quantities",
      "(reactions, thetas, anchorage sides, strips) swap sides."
    ]
  },
  "runs": [
