          { "path": "results.checks[id=anchorage.R].dcr", "value": 0.165517, "atol": 0.001, "note": "overhang-side bottom-tie anchorage (was anchorage.L in the left fixture). A2 update, hand: 4-#8 in b_gb 24 with 2 in side cover -> hooked-bar c/c s = (24-4-1)/3 = 6.3333 >= 6db -> psi_r = 1.0 (Table 25.4.3.2(b)); ldh = 60000*1.0*1.0*1.25*0.8/(55*sqrt(3000))*1^1.5 = 19.917184 in. Available unchanged = 31.867494/0.264827 = 120.333252 in -> dcr = 19.917184/120.333252 = 0.165517" },
          { "path": "results.checks[id=anchorage.L].dcr", "value": 0.515099, "atol": 0.001, "note": "far-side bottom-tie anchorage (was anchorage.R). A2 update, hand: same psi_r = 1.0 -> ldh = 19.917184 in; available unchanged = 31.867494/0.824159 = 38.666682 in -> dcr = 19.917184/38.666682 = 0.515099" },
          { "path": "results.checks[id=anchorage.freeEnd].dcr", "value": 1.2876, "atol": 0.001 },
